      "note": "Happy Thursday! We will start off with clear skies and increase our cloud cover and chance for precipitation throughout the day. Temperatures top out at 42F with 10mph westerlies cooling things off. Whether you came from near or far, from Park City or the Poconos, thank you to all our athletes, competitors, and fans for another great year of USASA. Special shoutout to anyone that braves the 22 foot super pipe! Remember to play it safe in our rapidly changing spring conditions. See you out there!",
